    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: MAR33.45 k formula",
      "summary": "The surcharge factor k in MAR33.45 divides by the sum of SA charges of green and amber desks and is undefined when that sum is zero.",
      "impact": "Position: Single amber desk whose SA_i = 0 (fully offset positions) Reading a: k = 0/0 undefined Reading b: Surcharge 0 Difference: division by zero",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
